# Venser, Fervent Forger: "They gain haste" is for as long as they exist, not until end of turn (CR 611.2a: no duration is
# stated). The delayed "at the beginning of the next end step, sacrifice them" is a real triggered ability (CR 603.7): Bot2
# Stifles it on the stack in the turn-3 end step, so the two Llanowar Elves tokens stay, and on turn 5 they still have
# haste (a delayed ability triggers only once, CR 603.7c, so nothing sacrifices them later either).

